        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "The OnFishingSetup() function in this config file is where you define the types of fish you want players to be able to catch. You can also define the environments where they are found, the tackle types they respond to, and the equipment they can be caught with. Additionally, you can add messages that will float above the player at different points in the fishing process. To understand how the system works, look at the example configuration provided in the file. If you double-click on the names of the functions, you can see comments documenting the purpose and use of the function."
          }
        }
      },
