        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Once you've created your fish, you need to place fishing spots in your module. You can use a waypoint or trigger for a fishing spot. Either way, set the tag to \"fish_fishingspot\". If you set a name for your fishing spot, it will act as the environment your fish is found in. You can combine multiple environments into a comma-separated list (e.g., \"river, lake\"). Try fishing near the mouth of the river to see this in action."
