            "0": "Finally, you need to create blueprints for the fish and equipment. Fish blueprints need to have a resref matching the value you referred to them as in fish_c_config, but this can be overriden using SetFishResRef() in fish_c_config.\n\nFishing equipment must have a tag starting with \"fish_t_equipment\" and have a \"Cast Spell: OnActivate (Unlimited Uses)\" item property. You can set the type of equipment in two ways:\n- set the tag to \"fish_t_equipment_X\", where X is the type of equipment, or\n- set the tag to \"fish_t_equipment\" and set the resref to the type of equipment"
          }
        }
      },
